1
00:00:00,967 --> 00:00:04,104
First, select the “CTA Canvas”

2
00:00:04,104 --> 00:00:08,875
Create “Hotspot Area” and set it as “Embed URL via Iframe”

3
00:00:08,875 --> 00:00:13,546
You can adjust the “Display Setting” & “Activation Method”

4
00:00:13,546 --> 00:00:17,851
You can decide how this feature to be displayed

5
00:00:17,851 --> 00:00:22,422
You can add shadow and stroke of your display as well

6
00:00:22,422 --> 00:00:25,792
Insert an unique url to be displayed in the window

7
00:00:25,792 --> 00:00:32,999
Or you can link your “VinMobi” or “VinDesk” project 

8
00:00:32,999 --> 00:00:40,573
The connected project will be displayed via Iframe
